Third-Party Licensing — Highcharts
-----------------------------------

Harmonize uses Highcharts (https://www.highcharts.com) for charting and data
visualization. Highcharts is free to use for non-commercial purposes such as
personal projects, school projects, and non-profit organizations under the
Highcharts Non-Commercial License.

For commercial use, or to access additional Highcharts modules (e.g.
Highcharts Stock, Highcharts Maps, Highcharts Gantt, or the Export Server),
a commercial license from Highsoft must be obtained. See:

  https://www.highcharts.com/license

Harmonize itself does not bundle or redistribute Highcharts — the chart
templates load it from a CDN or a local copy provided by the deploying
institution. The responsibility for complying with Highcharts licensing terms
lies with the deploying organization.
